Synthesis
  primes: dense atoms, many reps; ternary adds smoothing and enables Helfgott.
  polygonals: sparse polynomial atoms, but bounded arity kills local obstructions.
  Zeckendorf: exponentially sparse atoms; uniqueness replaces averaging.
  common object: representation hypergraph; the deep choice is smoothing vs normal form.
